export anchor AuroraGradientStyle:
    number: 27
    screen: LandingPage
    name: Aurora gradient
    idea: A modern startup page, with soft aurora mesh glows on white, a huge tightly tracked headline, a floating glassy pill nav and a generous centred hero.
    base: light
    palette:
        white: #ffffff, the page, windows and fields
        mist: #f6f6fa, table heads and the style sheet
        ink: #0b0d17, headlines, text and the primary pill
        slate: #545a6e, body copy, labels and nav links
        hairline: #e7e8ef, borders, dividers and progress tracks
        violet: #5a3ee0, the focus ring and the start of gradient text
        aurora: #b8a6ff, #8de3d6, #ffc7a8 and #ffb3d9, blurred glows and icon rings, never behind small text
        green: #157347, the On track pill
        amber: #8a5300, the At risk pill
        red: #b42318, the Overdue pill
    type:
        System sans, system-ui, -apple-system, Segoe UI, Roboto, Helvetica
        Neue, Arial, sans-serif, with small labels in ui-monospace, SF Mono,
        Menlo, Consolas, monospace. The headline is 104px bold at 0.98 line
        height with minus 0.055em tracking. Section titles are 52px bold,
        the quote 48px semibold with its second half in a violet to teal
        gradient, feature titles 19px, body 16px at 1.6, and eyebrows 12px
        mono uppercase tracked 0.08em.
    layout:
        A sticky glassy pill nav floats centred at the top with a gradient
        ring logo, quiet links and a small black Start free pill. Four large
        blurred aurora blobs in violet, mint, peach and pink glow behind the
        hero and fade to white. The hero is centred, with a small New chip,
        the huge headline, the lede, a black pill with an arrow and the tour
        link with a ringed play button. Below it a glass framed product
        window shows a projects table with progress bars, avatars, due dates
        and status pills. The logo strip is a row of grey wordmarks with
        small glyphs. Three features sit in columns split by hairlines with
        gradient ringed icon tiles and no cards. The quote is big and
        centred. The closing band is a 32px rounded panel filled with a
        soft aurora wash. The footer is minimal with mono headings. Below
        900px the nav links move into a centred row under the bar and
        columns stack.
    spacing: An 8px unit with big jumps, 72 to 112px between sections and 28 to 36px around the headline.
    density: Very airy. One centred column for the hero, text capped at 520 to 640px.
    corners: Pills for nav and buttons, 32px on the closing panel, 22px outer and 14px inner on the product window, 12px on fields and icon tiles.
    borders: 1px #e7e8ef hairlines, 1px white edges on glass, 1.5px aurora gradient rings on icon tiles.
    shadows: Long soft violet tinted drops, 0 40px 80px minus 30px rgba(43,22,140,0.35) under the window, and a small violet glow under the primary pill. Glass is 55 to 62 percent white with a 10 to 16px backdrop blur.
    icons:
        20px thin 1.6 stroke line icons in white tiles with a gradient
        ring. Status is a white pill with a ringed tick for On track, an
        outlined triangle with an exclamation mark for At risk and a filled
        square with a cross for Overdue, plus the word.
    focus: A 2px violet outline offset 3px. A focused field gets a violet border and a 4px soft violet ring.
    tone: Crisp and confident with short punchy lines, such as Less tracking. More finished work.
